            parts = listOf(
                StoryPart(1, "Platform Nine", listOf("Every Friday at 6:40, the station speakers announced a train that no longer appeared on any timetable: the last train to Elm Street.", "Most commuters ignored it. But Sami, who had recently moved into the flat above the station café, heard the announcement clearly and noticed the station clock pause for three seconds.", "The next morning, a retired conductor left a paper ticket on the café counter. It was dated thirty years earlier, and Sami's new address was written on the back.")),
