                StoryPart(8, "A New Platform", listOf("The residents met with the council and the trust manager. They agreed to restore the fund's purpose and create a garden beside the library.", "Sami found Ada's family through the address in the archive. Her granddaughter, Mariam, agreed to visit and bring the original garden plans.", "Before the meeting ended, the station speakers made the old announcement again. This time, Mr Okafor smiled instead of looking away.")),
