                StoryPart(10, "The Train Arrives", listOf("Mariam arranged a video call with Ada, now living near the coast. When the residents showed her the new garden, she covered her mouth and then laughed with relief.", "The first planting day brought neighbours together across generations. Mr Okafor rang the old station bell, and Jo read the names of the people who had kept the fund safe.", "At 6:40 that Friday, the speakers announced the last train to Elm Street. Sami no longer heard a ghostly message. He heard a reminder of a promise finally kept: the garden had returned, Ada's name was cleared, and the community had found its way back to one another.")
